  margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 3
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "p",
  text: "Organize your files in nested categories and view them by category with ease."
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "6"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 4
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text: **Decode Files Organizer** is a Shopify app that helps you organize your file catalog in nested categories and view files by category. Manage everything without leaving your Shopify admin.
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "p",
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "7"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  margin-top: 2rem;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 5
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "section"
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "8"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "h2",
  text: "Key features"
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "9"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          '''**Nested categories**: Organize your files in a hierarchy of categories. Add categories, build a parent-child tree, and assign files to categories. Choose a category to see its files—so you can browse and manage your file catalog by category instead of one long list.
'''
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "p",
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "10"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 3
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          '''**Settings:** Choose which columns to show so the table fits how you work. You can customize the functionality of the app by changing settings. For more help contact us at the [Support](/support) page in Shopify admin.
'''
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "p",
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "11"
      L: Attr
